-   Implemented `handleLocalRematchReset`: Resets the UI state to show the Lobby/Menu while keeping the multiplayer connection alive.
-   Implemented `handleRematchAction`: Sends the `REMATCH` packet (if Host) and triggers the local reset.
-   Updated Multiplayer Listener: Handles incoming `REMATCH` packets to trigger `handleLocalRematchReset` on the Client.
-   Updated `MultiplayerLobby` component usage: Passed `mpState` so the lobby knows if it should initialize in the "Waiting" view.
